        },
        {
          "text": "S. Nayak",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 513,
          "end": 521
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The petitioner has filed this writ petition seeking to quash the order dated 24.08.2023 passed in C.M.A. No.45 of 2021 (arising out of L.A.R. Case No.42 of 2008), by which the learned Senior Civil Judge, Nuapada has dismissed the said C.M.A. filed under Order 22 Rule 3 read with Section 151 of CPC.",
